g id="fig1" position="float"><label>Figure 1</label><caption><p>Effect of LA on growth inhibition in Ku-1 bladder cancer cellsand DU145 prostate cancer cells by long-term treatment. Ku-7 cells and DU145cells were continuously treated with LA (100 <italic>&#x003bc;</italic>g/mL) for the indicated period with weekly reseeding by 1 &#x000d7; 10<sup>5</sup> cells per well. If cells were less than 1 &#x000d7; 10<sup>5</sup> cells per well, allcells were reseeded. Standard deviation of each cell number was less than 10%of the value.</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="PPAR2008-529720.001"/></fig></floats-wrap></article>